# Focus DM Environment Configuration Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to .env:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Provide your Discord webhook URL to receive real-time canary monitoring alerts:
#   flutter run --dart-define-from-file=.env
